<view class="page {{entered ? 'in' : ''}}">
  <view class="head">
    <text class="title">设置</text>
    <text class="lead">这台手机怎么找到那台风扇。</text>
  </view>

  <conn-bar />

  <text class="group-label">Broker</text>
  <view class="group">
    <view class="row">
      <text class="row-k">地址</text>
      <input class="row-input" value="{{form.brokerUrl}}" data-field="brokerUrl" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="wss://broker.emqx.io:8084/mqtt" placeholder-class="ph" maxlength="200" />
    </view>
    <view class="row">
      <text class="row-k">订阅</text>
      <input class="row-input" value="{{form.statusTopic}}" data-field="statusTopic" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="sleepfan/status" placeholder-class="ph" maxlength="128" />
    </view>
    <view class="row">
      <text class="row-k">下行</text>
      <input class="row-input" value="{{form.cmdTopic}}" data-field="cmdTopic" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="sleepfan/cmd" placeholder-class="ph" maxlength="128" />
    </view>
  </view>
  <text class="help">公共 EMQX 用 wss://broker.emqx.io:8084/mqtt。开发阶段关掉合法域名校验。正式版必须是 wss，socket 域名只填 broker.emqx.io。</text>
  <text class="warn" wx:if="{{wsHint}}">现在是 ws://。开发者工具里也许能连，真机正式版要用 wss://。</text>
  <text class="help">下行主题只是预留。固件没有订阅，发出去风扇也不会动。</text>

  <text class="group-label">只看哪一台</text>
  <view class="group">
    <view class="row">
      <text class="row-k">过滤</text>
      <input class="row-input" value="{{form.clientIdFilter}}" data-field="clientIdFilter" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="空则全部，或 sleepfan-" placeholder-class="ph" maxlength="128" />
    </view>
  </view>
  <text class="help">公共 Broker 上可能有别人的报文。填写后，只留下 client_id 里包含这段文字的设备，区分大小写。</text>
  <view class="pair">
    <view class="text-btn" hover-class="press" hover-stay-time="70" hover-start-time="0" bindtap="usePrefix">过滤 sleepfan-</view>
    <view class="text-btn" hover-class="press" hover-stay-time="70" hover-start-time="0" bindtap="useLastDevice">只看最近设备</view>
  </view>
  <text class="help" wx:if="{{lastDeviceId}}">最近收到 {{lastDeviceId}}</text>
  <text class="help" wx:else>还没有记住设备。收到状态后，这里会出现 client_id。</text>

  <text class="group-label">这台手机</text>
  <view class="group">
    <view class="row id-row">
      <text class="cid" user-select="{{true}}">{{form.mqttClientId}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>
  <text class="help">小程序自己的 MQTT Client ID，前缀 wxsf-，存在本地，不会占用设备的 sleepfan-。</text>
  <view class="pair">
    <view class="text-btn" hover-class="press" hover-stay-time="70" hover-start-time="0" bindtap="onCopyId">复制</view>
    <view class="text-btn" hover-class="press" hover-stay-time="70" hover-start-time="0" bindtap="onRegen">重新生成</view>
  </view>

  <text class="warn" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</text>
  <text class="ok" wx:if="{{savedHint}}">{{savedHint}}</text>

  <view class="primary" hover-class="press" hover-stay-time="70" hover-start-time="0" bindtap="onSave">保存并重连</view>
  <view class="pair">
    <view class="text-btn ghost" hover-class="press" hover-stay-time="70" hover-start-time="0" bindtap="onReconnect">重新连接</view>
    <view class="text-btn ghost" hover-class="press" hover-stay-time="70" hover-start-time="0" bindtap="onReset">恢复默认</view>
  </view>

  <text class="group-label">联调</text>
  <text class="help">开发者工具：详情 → 本地设置 → 勾选「不校验合法域名、web-view（业务域名）、TLS 版本以及 HTTPS 证书」。</text>
  <text class="help">先用 MQTTX 订阅 sleepfan/status，确认 ESP32 有 JSON，再看这里是否变成已连接、监控页是否出现室温。</text>
</view>
